🟠 [minorder-at-least-1000] MUST-FIX src/minorder.js:4 `return cents > 1000;` rejects an order of exactly 1000 cents, but the contract says meetsMinimum is true when the order is at least 1000 cents (meetsMinimum(1000) → false); change to `cents >= 1000`
🟠 [invoice-shows-amount-and-tax] MUST-FIX src/invoice.js:5 returns `` `${label}: ${amount + taxCents(amount, rateBp)}` `` — numeric addition yielding a single summed number (e.g. "w: 1080") — but the contract's format "label: amount+tax" with "both in integer cents" requires both values shown (e.g. "w: 1000+80"); change to `` `${label}: ${amount}+${taxCents(amount, rateBp)}` ``
